      "desc": "The solar demo API, expressed as GraphQL.\n\nThis is the SAME API as solar-1.0.0-openapi-3.0.0-def.yaml — same entities,\nsame fields, same operations, same two planet actions — rendered the way a\nGraphQL team would naturally write it. That is the point: the two defs are a\nmatched pair, so the model apidef derives from each can be compared, and\n\"a GraphQL API produces the same SDK surface as its REST equivalent\" becomes\na checkable claim rather than an aspiration.\n\nKept in sync with the served schema in the solardemo app\n(sdkgen: ts/test/solardemo/app/def/solardemo-1.0.0-graphql.graphql).\n\nDeliberately idiomatic rather than a mechanical translation:\n  - collections are Relay connections, not bare lists\n  - mutations return payload wrappers carrying the entity\n  - the REST sub-resource path /planet/{id}/moon becomes a `planetId`\n    argument on `moons`, plus a `moons` connection on Planet\n  - terraform and forbid are plain mutations; they map to $action points\n    exactly as the REST action paths do"
    },
